Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 05:49:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] audio: a frontend sink, for frontends that bring their own
 audio output

AudioEngine::Frontend plays each stream through an output the frontend
registers (SetFrontendAudio): a thread per stream pulls 512-frame buffers
and hands them to the output, which blocks until it takes them. Without a
registered output it's the null sink.
